{"unit_id":"toyvfish__dsh-model-seat#card-zh","repo":"toyvfish/dsh-model-seat","commit":"9f9954aadb4b48d5b15f91022bf656d06e3df112","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-seat 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的模型选择器界面插件。它接入对话输入框的模型选择位置，使用 DSH 的会话模型目录读取并选择当前会话的模型，并在设置页注册外观面板。主要功能包括按提供方分组显示模型、品牌图标和简介，按模型名或提供方搜索，调整模型推理等级，以及自定义触发器、弹出面板和滑块的外观。适合希望更方便浏览和切换模型、并调整选择器样式的 DSH Web 用户。需要 DSH 提供模型目录和界面服务；无需额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.template.js:1229","src/client.template.js:1354","src/client.template.js:1916","index.js:53"]}
{"unit_id":"toyvfish__dsh-model-seat#card-en","repo":"toyvfish/dsh-model-seat","commit":"9f9954aadb4b48d5b15f91022bf656d06e3df112","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-seat replaces the DSH web composer's model picker with provider groups, model notes, brand marks and search. It selects models through the session directory, offers a reasoning-effort slider, and adds appearance settings. Requires DSH web UI and model-directory services; no extra API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.template.js:1229","src/client.template.js:1354","src/client.template.js:1916","index.js:53"]}
